  "slug": "guest-incident-post-event-review-form",
  "title": "Guest Incident Post-Event Review Form",
  "subtitle": "Close the case and look for the pattern: contributing conditions, recurrence, prevention actions, and what the venue changes.",
  "description": "An original case review for a closed or closing guest incident. It records the review identity and participants, the contributing conditions and how they were addressed, a recurrence check against prior incidents at the same location or of the same kind, the guest outcome, prevention actions with verification, and the changes carried into policy, training, or inspection routines.",
  "use_case": "Use after a guest incident case has been handled, when the venue needs to know whether the condition was actually fixed and whether the same thing has happened before. The review closes when prevention actions are verified and the recurrence position is recorded.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
