            "A prior prevention action did not hold",
            "A guest was transported for care",
            "A claim, legal demand, or regulatory contact is open",
            "The condition affects a route or space that cannot be closed",
            "Prevention requires capital work beyond the department's authority",
            "An accessible route or facility was involved"
          ]
        }
